A||||5||fieroshop||Poker Run||||1||
Z||000000||fieroshop||05-11-2000||01:28 AM||||Fiero Shop and Golden Gate Fieros are co-sponsoring their second annual poker run which will be held in Hayward Calif. This year it will on Sunday June 11th. This year we are expecting a lot more Fieros. Last year we had a great time. We had door prizes, an in-promtu car show, three prizes for the best poker hands, a barbecue and a lot of fun. <BR>For those of you who can make it please do. Please let me know in advance so that I can  estimate how much food to buy.<P>[This message has been edited by fieroshop (edited 05-11-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by fieroshop (edited 05-11-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||stimpy||05-11-2000||08:24 AM||||Had a whole lotta fun lat year!Wish I could make it this year. DEFinately not to be missed if you are in Northern CA! ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Big O||05-13-2000||10:17 AM||||George,<P>You can count me in.  I had a great time last year even if you did have to go and haul my car back to the shop.  It's a ways to go, but I wouldn't miss it.||||reg||14
Z||000003||Robert||05-13-2000||07:06 PM||||I'll be there again this year.  I dug up some photo's of last years event.<P>George explaining things!!!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2_4.jpg">  <P><BR>The start was very interesting<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1_7.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/5.jpg">  <P>The food was great<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3_3.jpg">  <P><BR>See the problems a $1.00 fuse can cause.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/4_1.jpg">  <P><p>[This message has been edited by Robert (edited 05-14-2000).]||||reg||10
Z||000004||stimpy||05-13-2000||09:00 PM||||DOH!!!<P>That's my paw!!! You can see the top of my head in the 'dinner' picture, left side of the table. George and his super-nice wife put on a great spread and the drive is very scenic. Make sure y'all bring a navigator though.||||reg||1
Z||000005||fieroshop||05-14-2000||04:14 PM||||Hey Robert, that brings back memories of all the work I had to do and this year it is going to be a much larger event and ofcourse more work for moi. OH WELL!! that's life in the fast lane.||||reg||1
